{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-02-15 17:00:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM GROUP INC. DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa070 CENTS\xa0PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE CORPORATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0APRIL 8, 2022\xa0TO OMNICOM GROUP COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MARCH 10, 2022."}